tesseract-robotics provides CMake targets.
The CMake package name is tesseract (not tesseract-ocr, and not the vcpkg port name):

  find_package(tesseract CONFIG REQUIRED COMPONENTS common environment)
  target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE tesseract::environment)

Config files live in share/tesseract/. Plugin DLLs are in bin/; put that directory on PATH at runtime.
